  "Software Details": "Szczegóły oprogramowania",
  "Welcome to the Auction Configuration Module of eCommerceGo SaaS! This module makes setting up auctions a breeze. With easy-to-use features, you can configure auction settings quickly and efficiently. Specify the start and end dates, along with start and end times for your auction. Add the product name you want to auction off, and you are all set. Plus, you can edit these settings whenever needed, ensuring flexibility and control over your auction process. Remember, once you add a product name, it cannot be added again, so you can manage your auction items effectively.": "Witamy w module konfiguracji aukcji eCommerceGo SaaS! ",
  "View Live Demo": "Zobacz demonstrację na żywo",
  "Efficient Product Management": "Efektywne zarządzanie produktami",
  "In the Auction Products section, you have complete control over the products in your auction. View the list of products currently up for auction and make edits as required. Need to update product details or pricing? No problem. With just a few clicks, you can modify product information, ensuring that your auction listings are always accurate and up to date. This feature makes it easy to keep track of your inventory and optimize your auction offerings.": "W sekcji Produkty na aukcji masz pełną kontrolę nad produktami na aukcji. ",
  "Real-Time Bidding Monitoring": "Monitorowanie licytacji w czasie rzeczywistym",
  "Stay informed about bidding activity with the Auction Product Orders page. Here, you can view a comprehensive list of products on which customers have placed bids. Track bids in real-time and manage orders efficiently. With clear visibility into customer activity, you can make informed decisions about pricing and inventory management. The Auction Product Orders page gives you the insights you need to maximize your auction revenue and optimize your business strategy.": "Bądź na bieżąco z informacjami o licytacjach na stronie Zamówienia produktów aukcyjnych. ",
  "Automated Updates for Seamless Management": "Automatyczne aktualizacje umożliwiające bezproblemowe zarządzanie",
  "Managing your auctions is a breeze with eCommerceGo SaaS. Take advantage of automated updates by adding corn job timing to the auction setting page. This ensures that your auction is corn job will keep updating at the specified time, without any manual intervention. By automating your auction updates, you can save time and streamline your workflow. Focus on growing your business while eCommerceGo takes care of the rest.": "Zarządzanie aukcjami jest proste dzięki eCommerceGo SaaS. ",
